x724 write x723 2
x725 text "A file starts with zero or more `use \"path.a0\"` lines, relative to the file. The linker loads every used file once, orders them by dependency, and validates the result as one program with one namespace. Cycles are rejected. A function name defined in two files is rejected with both locations. Diagnostics on a linked program name the file and line they belong to."
