x867 text "--parallel makes the C backend split two fold shapes across threads, reductions (add, mul, and, or, xor, min, max) and element-wise array maps, when a cost model says the loop is large enough; --parallel=gpu also offloads to Metal when built as Objective-C. Results are exact: the same bits as the serial program."
